<!-- G11a-1 fixture, written by hand for the tests of PPP (no source music): grace notes, in a right hand over a held left-hand note.
     Bar 1: a slashed grace before the very first note (nothing can sound before it), an unslashed grace before a half note.
     Bar 2: two slashed 16ths before a quarter note, and a slashed 16th after the last note of the bar.
     Bar 3: a chord of two unslashed graces before a half note; two unslashed QUARTER graces before an eighth (they must not outgrow the note). -->
